{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Life of a Magical Circle</strong> is a philosophical collect-and-survive roguelite about finding your purpose in life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a circle with your mouse. Eat smaller circles and uncover the rules of this strange world. Experiment, die, and be reborn until you understand your purpose; then come full circle with your mysterious narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control a magical circle with fluid, mouse-based movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dodge menacing triangles and squares</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eat smaller circles that will either help you find your purpose, or change the game in strange and amusing ways </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A mysterious narrator will react to your choices, reflect upon his own life, and wonder aloud about the nature of chasing one's dreams </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaze upon a beautiful, evolving, fractal-based background</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Listen to a wonderful soundtrack that you contribute to through your actions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 minutes to 3+ hours long depending on your skill level, how wise you are, and how much you want to see</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fulfilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408890/4fc840c70c9df2cc40d47ecfe9ebd34f59840a41.jpg"},{"name":"Perfected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2408890/4fc840c70c9df2cc40d47ecfe9ebd34f59840a41.jpg"},{"name":"Focused","path":"https://cdn.akamai